\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5.1}{\ignorespaces Independent validation of the ghost-separation formula $\Delta r(s,M)=sM/(P_0-M)$ against measured (incoherent) two-hole separation from a direct wave-optics simulation ($\mathtt  {grid\_N}=4096$, $a_{\mathrm  {hole}}=400\,\mu $m, $d_{\mathrm  {gap}}=12$\,mm), sweeping pitch $s$ at 8 myopia powers ($M=0$--$6$D). Right panel: $R^2=0.9951$ for the corrected formula, versus $R^2=-1701.7$ for the legacy formula this project explicitly disproved and stopped using (a negative $R^2$ -- worse than predicting the mean). A free 2-parameter affine fit recovers $A=1.041$, $B=-2.75\,\mu $m, close to the zero-intercept unit-slope line the physics predicts. Source: \texttt  {Array\_Design/array\_optimization/stage0\_ghost\_validation/} \texttt  {ghost\_formula\_validation.png}, mtime 2026-08-14, the original validation run this pipeline's own \texttt  {engine/ghost\_formula.py} was copied from (byte-for-byte verified against this same dataset, \texttt  {VALIDATION.md}).}}{30}{figure.5.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:ghost-validation}{{5.1}{30}{Independent validation of the ghost-separation formula $\Delta r(s,M)=sM/(P_0-M)$ against measured (incoherent) two-hole separation from a direct wave-optics simulation ($\mathtt {grid\_N}=4096$, $a_{\mathrm {hole}}=400\,\mu $m, $d_{\mathrm {gap}}=12$\,mm), sweeping pitch $s$ at 8 myopia powers ($M=0$--$6$D). Right panel: $R^2=0.9951$ for the corrected formula, versus $R^2=-1701.7$ for the legacy formula this project explicitly disproved and stopped using (a negative $R^2$ -- worse than predicting the mean). A free 2-parameter affine fit recovers $A=1.041$, $B=-2.75\,\mu $m, close to the zero-intercept unit-slope line the physics predicts. Source: \texttt {Array\_Design/array\_optimization/stage0\_ghost\_validation/} \texttt {ghost\_formula\_validation.png}, mtime 2026-08-14, the original validation run this pipeline's own \texttt {engine/ghost\_formula.py} was copied from (byte-for-byte verified against this same dataset, \texttt {VALIDATION.md})}{figure.5.1}{}}
